{
  "headline": "FDA's shortage list shows clindamycin in 5% dextrose injection current since 2023-03-21 with multiple manufacturers listed; no FDA action before the posting at a registered plant for our NDC",
  "headline_cites": ["E42", "E37", "E38", "E39", "E40"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the clindamycin phosphate injection shortage on 2023-03-21 and it remains current as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E42"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The FDA shortage list names Baxter Healthcare, Pfizer Inc., Sagent Pharmaceuticals, and Sandoz Inc. as current suppliers for this product.",
      "cites": ["E37", "E38", "E39", "E40"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our 6 mg/mL 50 mL bags (NDC 0781-3288-09) are labeled by Sandoz Inc. and manufactured at InfoRLife SA, a plant not placed in FDA's registration database.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E8", "E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bryant Ranch Prepack (FEI 1000519407), a relabel/repack plant for other clindamycin NDCs, received VAI classifications in 2022-03-17 (369 days before the shortage posting) and 2024-01-25 (310 days after), but it is not the manufacturer for our NDC.",
      "cites": ["D8", "D9", "D10", "E21"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Pharmacia & Upjohn Company LLC (FEI 1810189), a registered plant for another clindamycin NDC, was inspected 2023-06-16 (87 days after the shortage posting) and classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["D9", "E36", "E35"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 6.2 days of the 6 mg/mL 50 mL bags on hand; Corvale Lakeside has 19.2 days and can spare 21 bags while retaining a two-week supply.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D3", "D23"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-ranked option is to transfer 21 bags from Corvale Lakeside to Corvale East, which would raise Corvale East to 8 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D23"]
    }
  ]
}
